  "title": "Custom Christian scripture floral Blanket, Machine Washable - D10",
  "handle": "custom-christian-scripture-floral-blanket-machine-washable-d10",
  "body_html": "<p>Wrap yourself or a loved one in faith and comfort with this personalized Bible verse blanket from Jeminise. This inspirational blanket is a heartfelt gift for any Christian woman, mom, grandma, or daughter, offering warmth and daily encouragement with scripture.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Gift:</strong> An inspirational and religious gift, perfect for birthdays, Christmas, or baptisms.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize with a name or date to create a unique, faith-filled keepsake.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Feel:</strong> Made with skin-friendly fabric for ultimate comfort and warmth during prayer or quiet time.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Choose from 30x40, 50x60, or 60x80 inches to suit various needs and uses.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Uplifting Verses:</strong> Features uplifting Bible verses to provide peace and daily encouragement.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water and air dry for quick and convenient cleaning.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Cotton/ Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>D14</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Modern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Christmas, Religious</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>butterflies, floral, cloud, cross</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Blanket Form</th>\n<td>Throw Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>2 text inputs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>S/M/L/XL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Size</th>\n<td>40\"L x 30\"W</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Customizable, Lightweight</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Recommended Uses For Product</th>\n<td>Indoor</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
